<title>FRANCE: Highlights of ONIC barley estimates.</title>
<headline>Highlights of ONIC barley estimates.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>French cereals office ONIC monthly barley estimates (July/June, million tonnes).</p>
<p>			   96/97 (Mar)    96/97 (Feb)   95/96</p>
<p> Opening stocks	0.626	    0.626	   0.401</p>
<p> Harvested crop	9.500	    9.500	   7.739</p>
<p> Use on farms	  2.610	    2.610	   2.473</p>
<p> Other domestic use  1.585	    1.535	   1.496</p>
<p>  - incl.animal feed 0.950	    0.900	   0.867</p>
<p> Exports to EU	 2.280	    2.260	   2.244</p>
<p> Exports to non-EU   1.500	    1.500	   0.221</p>
<p> Final stock	   1.045	    1.115	   0.626</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
</text>
